  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) corned beef brisket with spice packet",
    "10 small red potatoes",
    "5 medium carrots",
    "1 large head cabbage"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ot_N1sa2zbubBbOba2ouiRB2iBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16310-corned-beef-and-cabbage-i-step-01-c0b66a267a234770afac3465a303439f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16310/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place corned beef in a Dutch oven and cover with water. Add spice packet, cover, and bring to a boil. Reduce heat and simmer until corned beef is just about fork-tender, about 2 hours. While the corned beef is simmering, cut potatoes in half. Peel carrots and cut into 3-inch pieces. Cut cabbage into small wedges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XIMS2q6SwPQJKBCWPSYqbPeHhvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16310-corned-beef-cabbage-mfs-048-step2-c17eed59ff08498783a5e66b5a74c9bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16310/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When corned beef has cooked for 2 hours, add potatoes and carrots; cook until vegetables are almost tender, about 10 minutes. Add cabbage and continue to cook until potatoes are tender, about 15 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e8hFEE3XyiTdfP3hxYQNYLe7B2M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16310-corned-beef-cabbage-mfs-050-step4-7e591006d8fe402880d6c6fd42919085.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16310/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove meat and let rest for 15 minutes. Leave broth and vegetables in the Dutch oven.Slice meat across the grain. Serve with vegetables and broth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xPSGbNV0amXHKsAG6sU4zgE8mf4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16310-corned-beef-and-cabbage-i-DDMFS-4x3-19a894131bbf4ecea8a539a2e53f17ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16310/step_04.webp"
    }
